<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PEERLESS RAISED.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PEERLESS RAISED.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hambrecht &amp; Quist said it raised its rating on Peerless Systems to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- H&amp;Q analysts Sheila Ennis and Matt Belkin cited acceleration in demand for printer software company Peerless, which is benefiting as OEMs increasingly outsource software components to specialists.</p>
</text>
